@dwex
title: CV-06 - Redundant convoyer, only the connected one matters
desc:  When several fleets carry con orders for the same army but only
       one of them is geographically wired into a viable chain, the
       conflict resolver should use that one. The disconnected extra
       convoyer (ION) doesn't help and doesn't hurt; it just holds.

map {
  Edi LCB 0, 0.0
  NTH O   1, 0.6
  Bel LC  2, 0.0
  ION O   2,-1.0
  Edi --F NTH
  NTH --F Bel
}

orders {
  En A Edi mve Bel
  En F NTH con Edi
  En F ION con Edi
}
@end
